<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">PATIENT INTENT</span><div><h2>They were already<br/>looking for treatment.</h2><p class="statement">Google’s role was not to create the need. It was to make Denta visible at the moment the patient acted on it.</p><p>Campaign management focused on measurable calls and lead actions, with performance reviewed as a patient-acquisition channel rather than a source of clicks.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="accent-section"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">2025 / PERFORMANCE</span><h2>10,601 conversions.<br/>€2.07 weighted CPA.</h2><div class="flow"><span>SEARCH INTENT</span><b>→</b><span>GOOGLE AD</span><b>→</b><span>RELEVANT PAGE</span><b>→</b><span>CALL / LEAD</span></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">SCALE</span><div><h2>Volume without<br/>losing measurement.</h2><p>In 2024 the reporting file records 6,803 Google Ads conversions. In 2025 that reached 10,601. For January–August 2026 another 8,087 conversions were tracked.</p><p class="statement">The point is not one exceptional month. It is repeatable acquisition across years.</p></div></div><div class="proof-grid"><div class="proof"><span class="eyebrow">2024</span><strong>6,803</strong><small>Google Ads conversions</small></div><div class="proof"><span class="eyebrow">2025</span><strong>10,601</strong><small>Google Ads conversions</small></div><div class="proof"><span class="eyebrow">2026 / JAN–AUG</span><strong>8,087</strong><small>Google Ads conversions</small></div></div></section>
<section class="case-section dark"><div class="shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">MEASUREMENT</span><div><h2>Optimise for response,<br/>not traffic.</h2><p class="statement">Calls + lead actions were the operating KPI.</p><p>That kept campaign decisions anchored to what matters commercially: whether search demand turned into a patient enquiry.</p></div></div></div></section>
